The moments at {0,0,0} and {1/2,0,0} point along +z and -z. Use \
showCrystalStructure to draw the atoms and their opposite moments:\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"90c957b1-ade1-4198-9e7d-34dd9f43da01"],

